# Privacy Policy for الحناوي (Elhenawy)

**Last updated / آخر تحديث:** September 16, 2026 / 16 سبتمبر 2026

> **مسودة للاستكمال قبل النشر:** استبدل جميع الحقول بين `[أكمل: ...]` في النسختين، واعتمد ممارسات الخادم ومزودي الخدمات ومدد الاحتفاظ الفعلية. اسم المطور وبريد تطبيق FTTech Pro في المثال لا يُعدّان بيانات مؤكدة للحناوي. احذف هذه الملاحظة بعد الاستكمال، وانشر السياسة على رابط عام. هذه النسخة تخص `com.elhenawy.app`، وليست معرّف التطبيق الموجود في ملف الخصوصية القديم.

## Privacy Policy — English

This Privacy Policy applies to the mobile application **الحناوي (Elhenawy)** for Android and iOS (package name / bundle identifier: `com.elhenawy.app`). The entity responsible for the personal data described in this policy is **[أكمل: الاسم القانوني للجهة المسؤولة عن البيانات]**, referred to as “we,” “us,” or “our.”

### 1. Information We Collect

We process information according to the features you use:

- **Account information:** your name, email address, phone number, account identifier, login credentials used for authentication, and profile picture if you upload one.
- **Shopping and order information:** cart contents, favorites, delivery addresses, order details and history, order status, and any loyalty or wallet records associated with the features available to your account.
- **Location information:** the address or map position you select, and your device location when you grant permission and use location-assisted address selection. Location precision depends on your permission settings and device.
- **Payment-related information:** your selected payment method and information associated with the order and its payment status. **[أكمل: طرق الدفع الفعلية، وبيانات الدفع التي تعالجها الجهة أو مزود الدفع، وما إذا كانت بيانات البطاقات تُجمع ومن يجمعها]**.
- **Support and assistant content:** messages and requests you send to customer support or the in-app assistant, including conversation identifiers and history used to retrieve previous conversations.
- **Voice-search input:** speech provided when you activate voice search, and the text produced by speech recognition. The speech service may process audio on the device or remotely, depending on the device and service configuration. **[أكمل: مزود معالجة الصوت وسياسة الاحتفاظ بالصوت والنص]**.
- **Notification information:** push notification tokens and notification preferences used to deliver notifications to your device.
- **Technical information:** information processed by the server and service providers when your device connects to them. **[أكمل: بيانات السجلات والتشخيص التي تُجمع فعليًا، مثل عنوان IP وإصدار الجهاز، وأغراضها ومدد الاحتفاظ بها]**.

### 2. Permissions and Device Features

The app may request access to the following features:

- **Location:** to help you select a delivery address on a map.
- **Photos:** to select and upload a profile picture.
- **Microphone and speech recognition:** to convert spoken words into a product search when you use voice search.
- **Notifications:** to send order updates, account alerts, and offers according to the service settings and your preferences.
- **Face ID or other device biometrics:** to authenticate you through your device’s biometric system. The app receives an authentication result, rather than your fingerprint or facial biometric template.

You can manage permissions in your device settings. Refusing or withdrawing a permission may prevent the associated feature from working. The app also uses an internet connection to access products, accounts, orders, and other online services.

### 3. Third-Party Services

The app integrates with services that process information to provide their functions:

- **Google Firebase Cloud Messaging and Firebase Core:** app integration and push notification delivery. [Firebase Privacy and Security](https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy).
- **Google Maps and relevant Google services:** maps, address selection, and geocoding. [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy).
- **Apple services, including APNs and speech recognition where used:** notification delivery and speech-to-text functionality on Apple devices. [Apple Privacy Policy](https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/).
- **The speech recognition service available on your Android device:** processing spoken search input according to the service selected by the device.
- **Hosting and order fulfillment providers:** **[أكمل: أسماء مزودي الاستضافة والتوصيل الفعليين، والبيانات اللازمة التي يتلقونها]**.
- **AI service providers, if assistant requests are forwarded to an external provider:** **[أكمل: اسم المزود ورابط سياسته والبيانات المرسلة إليه، ومدة الاحتفاظ بها، وما إذا كانت تستخدم لتدريب النماذج]**.
- **Other active providers:** **[أكمل: مزود الدفع أو مزود خرائط بديل مثل OpenStreetMap إذا استُخدم فعليًا، وروابط السياسات؛ احذف هذا البند إن لم ينطبق]**.

Assistant messages are sent to our backend to provide responses, and conversation history can be retrieved through the app. Do not include passwords or payment card details in these messages. Any required notice and consent for sharing personal information with an external AI provider must be presented before that sharing occurs.

### 4. How We Use Information

We use information to:

- Create and manage accounts and authenticate users.
- Display products and manage carts, favorites, addresses, and orders.
- Process and fulfill orders and maintain the associated records.
- Provide available loyalty and wallet features.
- Respond to support requests and assistant messages.
- Deliver notifications according to your preferences and applicable requirements.
- Maintain the service, investigate technical problems, prevent misuse, and meet applicable legal obligations.

### 5. Sharing and Disclosure

Information may be disclosed to service providers for the purposes described above, to delivery providers as needed to fulfill an order, or to competent authorities where required by applicable law.

**Sale, advertising, and tracking:** **[أكمل: التصريح المعتمد بشأن بيع البيانات ومشاركتها لأغراض الإعلان أو التتبع، بما يطابق الممارسات الفعلية وإقرارات المتجر]**.

### 6. Data Retention and Account Deletion

Retention depends on the type of information, the service it supports, and applicable legal requirements.

**[أكمل: مدة أو معيار الاحتفاظ ببيانات الحساب والطلبات والدعم والمحادثات والسجلات والنسخ الاحتياطية، والبيانات المحتفظ بها لأسباب قانونية ومدتها]**.

You can request account deletion through the **Delete Account** option in the app settings. The app asks for your password to confirm the request. You can also use **[أكمل: رابط ويب عام لطلب حذف الحساب والبيانات]** or contact **[أكمل: بريد الخصوصية أو الدعم]**.

**[أكمل: المدة الفعلية لمعالجة طلب الحذف، وما يُحذف أو يُفصل عن هوية المستخدم، والاستثناءات القانونية وكيفية التعامل مع النسخ الاحتياطية]**.

Uninstalling the app does not itself submit an account deletion request.

### 7. Your Choices and Rights

You can update available account information in the app, change notification preferences, and manage device permissions through the operating system settings.

Depending on the laws that apply to you, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or obtain a copy of your personal data, restrict or object to certain processing, and withdraw consent where processing relies on consent. You may also have the right to complain to the relevant data protection authority. Contact us using the details below to submit a request; we may need to verify your identity.

**Where applicable:** **[أكمل: الأسس القانونية لمعالجة البيانات، وبلدان التخزين أو المعالجة، وضمانات النقل الدولي، وبيانات ممثل حماية البيانات أو المسؤول المختص إذا كانت مطلوبة]**.

### 8. Data Security

The app’s configured backend endpoint uses HTTPS. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure.

**[أكمل: التدابير التنظيمية والتقنية المطبقة فعليًا لحماية البيانات، دون وعود بتشفير التخزين أو ضمانات غير مثبتة]**.

### 9. Children

**[أكمل: الجمهور العمري المقصود والحد الأدنى للعمر، وكيفية التعامل مع بيانات القاصرين وموافقة ولي الأمر عند انطباقها، وفق البلدان المستهدفة وإعدادات المتجر]**.

If you believe a child has provided personal information in violation of the applicable requirements, please contact us so that we can investigate and take appropriate action.

### 10. Changes to This Policy

We may update this policy to reflect changes to the app, our data practices, or applicable requirements. The “Last updated” date will indicate the latest revision. Where required, we will notify you of material changes and obtain any necessary consent.

